    "chunk_text": "The state land area of 18.17 Ha. located within Matugama Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kalutara District, Western Province in Sri Lanka located within the area depicted by the following geodesic coordinates. (Survey method \u2013 Geodesic coordinates EPSG : 5234 method).\n\nExtent: 18.17 Ha.\n\n11-82/3\n\nFOREST CONSERVATION ORDINANCE THE order under Section 3. that has to be read with Section 64. (1) of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451), as No. 13 of 1966, as amended by Acts, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009 that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.\n\nThe Order\n\nBy virtue of powers vested in me by Section 3. of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451) as amended by Acts, No. 13 of 1966, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009, that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, Maithripala Sirisena, President do by this order declare the Lulbadduwa Mangrove Forest of 44.97 Hectares bounded by the limit set forth in the Schedule hereto as Lulbadduwa Mangrove Reserved Forest from 12th day of October, 2019. MAITHRIPALA SIRISENA, President. Polonnaruwa, 12th day of October, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nThe state land area of 44.97 Ha. located within Walallawita Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kaluthara District, Western Province in Sri Lanka located within the area depicted by the following geodesic coordinates. (Survey method \u2013 Geodesic coordinates EPSG : 5234 method).\n\n4 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 : (1) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.10.16 PART I : Sec (1) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 16.10.2019"
