    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2145/36 - 2019 \u0d94\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dd9\u0dad\u0ddd\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc3 16 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.10.16\n\nNo. 2145/36 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, OCTOBER 16, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A- PG 4711\u2014 92 (2019/10)\n\nFOREST CONSERVATION ORDINANCE THE order under Section 3 that has to be read with Section 64.(1) of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451), as No. 13 of 1966, as amended by Acts, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009 that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. THE ORDER By virtue of powers vested in me by Section 3.of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451) as amended by Acts, No. 13 of 1966, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009, that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, Maithripala Sirisena, President do by this order declare the Achchankulam Mangrove Forest of 1405.79 hectares bounded by the limit set forth in the schedule hereto as Achchankulam Mangrove Reserved Forest from 12th day of October, 2019. MAITHRIPALA SIRISENA, President. 12th day of October, 2019, Polonnaruwa.\n\n2 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 : (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \