    "chunk_text": "By South : Lot number 281, 350, 289, 351 of F.V.P.306, lot number 518, 513, 518, Pradeshiya sabaha road, 518, 16 (Canal), 518, 517 (Canal), 16 (Canal), 518, 7 (Canal) of F.V.P.304, Lot number 352 (Ratna Ella tank) of F.V.P.306.\n\nBy West: Lot number 352, (Ratna Ella tank), 353, 354 of F.V.P.306. Extent: 64.0458 Ha. 11 - 94\n\nFOREST CONSERVATION ORDINANCE\n\nThe Order\n\nBy virtue of powers vested in me by Section 3A. of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451) as amended by Acts, No. 13 of 1966, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009, that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19thamendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, Maithripala Sirisena, Precedent do by this order declare the Liyanagemulla Mangrove Forest of 10.43 Hectares bounded by the limit set forth in the schedule hereto as Liyanagemulla Mangrove Conservation Forest from 12th day of October, 2019.\n\nMAITHRIPALA SIRISENA, President. 12th day of October, 2019, Polonnaruwa.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nThe state land area of 10.43 Ha. located within Negambo Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Gampaha District, Western Province located within the area depicted by the following geodesic coordinates. (Survey method-Geodesic coordinates EPSG : 5234 method).\n\n4 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 : (1) \u0dd9\u014e\u0daf\u0dba - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.10.16 PART I : Sec (1) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 16.10.2019"
