    "chunk_text": "FOREST CONSERVATION ORDINANCE\n\nTHE order under Section 3. that has to be read with Section 64. (1) of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451), asNo. 13 of 1966, as amended by Acts, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009 that haveto be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.\n\nThe Order\n\nBy virtue of powers vested in me by Section 3.of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451) as amended by Acts,No. 13 of 1966, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009, that have to be read withSection 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, Maithripala Sirisena,President do by this order declare the Karamidula Forest of 75.1453 hectares bounded by the limit set forth in the schedulehereto as Karamidula Reserved Forest from 12th day of October, 2019.\n\nMAITHRIPALA SIRISENA,\n\nPresident.\n\nPolonnaruwa,12th October, 2019.\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2145$41 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 16 jeks nodod - 2019'10'16\n\nNo. 2145/41 - WEDNESDAY, OCTOBER 16, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - PG 4703 - 100 (2019/10)\n\n2 AI fldgi: (I) fPoh - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'16PART 1: SEC. (1) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 16.10.2019\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nThe forest area comprising Lot Numbers 1, 3, 4 and 5 of PP kq 3175 compiled by Sri Lanka Survey Department representingKaramidula, Bambaragama, Agappola, Kithulpe, Bowala and Yakadagoda Villages of Hanguranketa Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivi