    "chunk_text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Divisional Secretariat of Dickwella, on the 23rd day ofOctober, 2019 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notifyto me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 16th day ofOctober, 2019 the nature of their interests in the land, theparticulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisitionof the said land/servitude the amount of compensation andthe details of the computation of such amount.\n\nB. S. RANJITHA,Divisional Secretary,\n\nDickwella.\n\nDivisional Secretariat,Dickwella.16th day of September, 2019.\n\n11 - 86\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nI, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, No.28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire land /servitude right of the following Landwhich is required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land/servitude to be Acquired:\n\nTo obtain the servitude rights of an allotment of land forlaying pipe lines from Nawayalavila Reservoir to NalagamaWater Treatment Plant under Tangalle Water Supply Project.\n\nSeven allotments of lands called as Suriyagahawaththa,Galekella, Galwaththa, Nugekumbura Karamane Kumbura,Berawathu Kumbura depicted as lot No. 857, 858, 859, 860,861, 862, 863 with total extent about 0.8441 Ha. in the preliminaryplan dated 21.10.2015 and F. V. P. 290 prepared by the SurveyorGeneral and one allotment named as Elenkanaththa with totalextent of 0.0922 Ha. depicted as lot No. 149 depicted inpreliminary plan dated 21.10.2015 and F.V.P. 313 prepared bythe Surveyor General in the village of Nalagama andPlommaruwa within the Grama Niladhari Division of NalagamaWest in the minor division of Giruwapaththuwa East in theDivisional Secretary Division of Tangalle, in HambanthotaDistrict, Southern Province."
