    "chunk_text": "wxl 2145$51 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 17 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'10'17\n\nNo. 2145/51 \u2013 THURSDAY, OCTOBER 17, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nG 31274 - 12 (10/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nLand Ministry Reference No.: 4-3/2/2016/A/463. Divisional Secretary Ref. No.: KMB/LAN/ACQUI/02/83.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsthe following land/servitude which is required for a publicpurpose.\n\nDescription of the Land/Servitude to be Acquired :The allotment of the land mentiones below depicted in PPMR 2813, situated in No. 331, Mapalana Magin Pahala Grama\n\nNiladhari Division, in the Divisional Secretary's Division ofKamburupitiya in Matara District in Southern Province.\n\nLot No. 1Name of the land: Giragahahenawatta; Description:Garden, 22 Jak trees about 10-50 years old, 13 Mango trees,one Mahogani tree, 54 Rubber trees, 39 Kithul trees, one Cocoatree, 2 Durian trees, 2 Goraka trees, 9 aettoniya trees, 80 Arecatrees, 2 Ambarella trees, 2 Donga trees, one Olinda mara tree,one Thimbiri tree, one Turpentine tree, 4 Rukaththana trees,10 Clove trees, 3 Cashew trees, one Ketakala tree, 2 Beli trees,a mixed cropping, 3 permanent building and a well; Name andAddress of Claimant: Land Reform Commission; HectorKobbekaduwa mw., Colombo 07; Extent: 1.8525 Hectares.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear\n\nIII fldgi - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'17