    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'10'19PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 19.10.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is neededfor a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions ofthat Act.\n\nAn allotment of land depicted in the Advanced TracingNo. B/ACQ/WML/2018/525 dated 10.01.2019, prepared by theSurveyor-General, situated in the Village of Dabawinna (F.V.P. 59) inthe Grama Niladhari Division of 59 A Dabawinna in the MinorDivision of Dabawinna Palatha Korale in the Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivision of Welimada in the District of Badulla in Uva Province andbounded as follows:\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2145$56 \u2013 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be 19 jeks fikiqrdod \u2013 2019'10'19No. 2145/56 \u2013 SATURDAY, OCTOBER 19, 2019\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Ampitigoda Patana \u2013 Extent: 0.8094 HectareNorth and East: Lot No. 11c of F.V.P. 59 and Road; South: Road;West: Lot No. 11c of F.V.P. 59 and Road.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nRef. No.: 4-3/5/2018/J/259.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.01st August, 2019.\n\n11 \u2013 483\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G 31281 \u2013 11 (10/2019)PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
