    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'21PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 21.10.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2146$12 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 21 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'10'21No. 2146/12 - MONDAY, OCTOBER 21, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 31296\u2014 42 (10/2019)\n\nAMENDMENT\n\nMERITORIOUS SERVICE MEDAL\n\nOrders\n\nREGULATIONS mentioned in the following paragraphs, numbered as First, Second, Fourth, and Fifth published in theGovernment Gazette Extraordinary Number 2112/32 dated 28.02.2019, of the Democratic Socialist Republic of SriLanka for the Meritorious Service Medal are hereby amended:\n\nFirst Paragraph:Style and Designation - It is ordained that the medal shall be styled and designated the\"SEVABHIMANI PADAKKAMA\".\n\nSecond Paragraph:Description - It is ordained that the medal shall be of Gold colour metal and the flower of eightpetals in shape, with a diameter of 3.7 cm bearing in the centre of the surface a design comprisingan Eagle in flight head to the sinister superimposed on an Anchor with a chain twined around it, thewhole superimposed upon two crossed swords points uppermost surrounded by the legend\"SEVABHIMANI PADAKKAMA\" embossed in Sinhala, Tamil and English and in the relief on thereverse the Armorial Ensign of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka surrounded by a lotuspetal border within aears of paddy surrounded by the wheel of Doctrine with the filled Vessel atthe base and the depiction of Sun in splendour and the Moon on the right and left respectively andthe year of institution \"2009\" embossed below it."
