    "chunk_text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'10'22PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 22.10.20191A\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G31312 \u2013 12 (10/2019)\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nw;s \u00fafYIThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nwxl 2146$18 \u2013 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 22 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod \u2013 2019'10'22No. 2146/18 \u2013 TUESDAY, OCTOBER 22, 2019\n\nPILGRIMAGES ORDINANCE\n\nREGULATIONS made by the Minister of Internal & Home Affairs and Provincial Councils & Local Government in terms ofsection 2 of Pilgrimages Ordinance. (Chap. 175)\n\nWAJIRA ABEYWARDHANA,Internal & Home Affairs and Provincial Councils andLocal Government\n\nMinistry of Internal and Home Affairs and Provincial Councils and Local Government,Nila Medura Building,Elvitigala Mawatha,Narahenpita,Colombo 05.04th October, 2019.\n\nRegulations\n\n1.These regulations may be cited as the regulation of Duruthu Maha Perahera Festival of Sri Maha Vihara Temple,in the Grama Niladari\u2019s Division of No. 152, Pilana Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Akmeemana, Galle District.\n\n2AI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'10'22PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 22.10.2019\n\n2.In these regulations :\n\n\u201cCamp area\u201d means the area described in the schedule.\n\n\u201cDistrict Secretary/ Government Agent\u201d means the Government Agent of Galle administrative district and italso includes any officer authorized by him in terms of regulation 4.\n\n\u201cMedical Officer\u201d means the Medical officer of health in charge of the camp area.\n\n\u2018Pilgrim\u201d means any person who enters and stays within the camp area for any purpose.\n\n\u201cPolice Officer\u201d includes any Grama Niladhari in charge of the camp area."
  },
