    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'10'24PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 24.10.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nORDER UNDER SECTION 39A(1)\n\nTHE allotment specified in the Order No. 308 of 2014 made underthe Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act(Chapter 460) and published in the Gazette Extra OrdinaryNo. 1887/41 dated 07.11.2014 is vested absolutely in the State andthe possession of which has been taken for or on behalf of the Stateunder Para (a) of Section 40 of the aforesaid Act. But by the virtue ofpowers vested in me by Sub-section (1) of Section 39(a) (inserted byAct, No. 8 of 1979) of the Land Acquisition Act. I, GayanthaKarunatilleke, Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,do hereby divest only the alltoment described in the Schedule Ibelow.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/10/2012/LRB/324-II.Acquiring Officer No.: WRSWD&EIP/ACQ/KB/16.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Avenue,Battaramulla.18th October, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nAn Allotment of land depicted in below name and extent in SheetNo. 2 Block 16 of 18 in the Cadastral Map No. 521203 dated19.05.2016 prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Villagecalled Thumbowila in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 576 A ofThumbowila North in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kesbewain Colombo District of the Western Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 94 \u2013 Uruwalaowita \u2013 Extent: About 0.6150 HectareNorth: Lot No. 93, Duwawatta Road, Lot Nos. 01 and 95; East:Lot Nos. 01 and 95; South: Lot No. 95; West: Lot Nos. 95 and 93.\n\n11 \u2013 766\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n