    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'10'24PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 24.10.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nORDER UNDER SECTION 39A(1)\n\nTHE allotment specified in the Order No. 42 of 2013 made under theProviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act(Chapter 460) and published in the Gazette Extra OrdinaryNo. 1796/18 dated 07.02.2013 is vested absolutely in the State andthe possession of which has been taken for or on behalf of the Stateunder Para (a) of Section 40 of the aforesaid Act. But by the virtue ofpowers vested in me by Sub-section (1) of Section 39(a) (inserted byAct, No. 8 of 1979) of the Land Acquisition Act. I, GayanthaKarunatilleke, Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,do hereby divest only the alltoment described in the Schedule 1below.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/10/2012/LRB/19Acquiring Officer No.: WGSWD&EIP/ACQ/DW/01.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Avenue,Battaramulla.18th October, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nAn Allotment of land depicted in below name and extent in theamended Preliminary Plan No. Co. 9463 dated 09.10.2018 preparedby the Surveyor-General, situated in the Villages called Kalubowila,Papiliyana in the Grama Niladhari Divisions No. 537 B of Kohuwalaand No. 526 D of Jambugasmulla in the Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivisions of Kesbewa, Dehiwala, Maharagama in Colombo Districtof Western Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 58 \u2013 Part of land bearing Assmt. No. 33 at FieldMawatha \u2013 Extent: About 0.0022 HectareNorth: Lot No. 6, lands bearing Assmt. Nos. 306 and 33 at FieldMawatha; East: Land bearing Assmt. No. 33 at Field Mawatha;South: Field Mawatha; West: Lot No. 59.\n\n11 \u2013 767\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u0