    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'10'25PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 25.10.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nORDER UNDER SECTION 39A(1)\n\nTHE allotments specified in the Order No. 128 of 2000 made underthe Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act(Chapter 460) and published in the Gazette Extra OrdinaryNo. 1133/20 dated 26.05.2000 is vested absolutely in the State andthe possession of which has been taken for or on behalf of the Stateunder Para (a) of Section 40 of the aforesaid Act. But by the virtue ofpowers vested in me by Sub-section (1) of Section 39(a) (inserted byAct, No. 8 of 1979) of the Land Acquisition Act. I, GayanthaKarunatilleke, Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,do hereby divest only the allotment described in the Schedule 1below.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy No.: 13/99/D/260.Acquiring Officer No.: DIVPANN/LND/ACDEP/1/4/6.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Avenue,Battaramulla.18th October, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nAn Allotment of land depicted in below name and extent in theField Book l='4536, Supplement 23, Sheet 19, F.V.P. No. 381 dated05.11.2001 prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Villagecalled Malgamuwa in the Minor Division of Medapattu Korale Eastin the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Pannala in KurunegalaDistrict of North Western Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 123 \u2013 Ibulgahamulawatta \u2013 Extent: About0.063 HectareNorth: Lot Nos. 122 and 121; East: Lot Nos. 121 and 95; South:Road; West: Lot No. 29."
