oad,Battaramulla.29th May, 2019.\n\n11 \u2013 889\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G 31335 \u2013 16 (10/2019)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA"
