    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.10.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2147$27 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 28 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'10'28No. 2147/27 - MONDAY OCTOBER 28, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE POLONNARUWAMUNICIPAL COUNCIL UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Polonnaruwa Municipal Council has fallen vacant by reason of Death ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United National Party, the recognized political party to which MohamaduIbraheem Mohamadu Arfa the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66A(1) of the aforesaid ordinance, todecide upon returned member of United National Party who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under section9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty(30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Jayasundara Korale Mudiyanse Ralahamilage Sujeewa Nishantha Gunathilaka to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Leelanath Wickrama Arachchi, Returning Officer of the Polonnaruwa Municipal Council,acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare thatJayasundara Korale Mudiyanse Ralahamilage Sujeewa Nishantha Gunathilaka was selected as the member of the PolonnaruwaMunicipal Council.\n\nLEELANATH WICKRAMA ARACHCHI,Returning Officer,Polonnaruwa Municipal Council.District Election Office,Polonnaruwa,28th October, 2019.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
