    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'29PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 29.10.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2147$47 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 29 jeks w`.yrejdod - 2019'10'29No. 2147/47 - TUESDAY, OCTOBER 29, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nL.D.B. 104/44(v)\n\nTRUSTS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 87)\n\nOrder under Section 114\n\nWHEREAS the Trustees of \u201cthe Trustees of the Society of Jesus in Sri Lanka\u201d namely -\n\n1.Reverend Father Dexter Fredric Gray,2.Reverend Father Noel Felix Anton Pieris,3.Reverend Father George Anthony Fernando,4.Reverend Father Clement Ranjan Jayamanne.\n\nhave applied to the Minister of Justice and Prison Reforms for their incorporation under Section 114 of theTrusts Ordinance (Chapter 87) ;\n\nNow therefore, by virtue of the powers vested in me by the aforesaid Ordinance, I, Thalatha Athukorala, Ministerof Justice and Prison Reforms, do by this Order authorize the incorporation of the said Trustees, and direct and declarethat-\n\n(a)the Trustees of the said Trust named above and their successors for the time being duly appointed underthe Deed of Trust bearing No. 486 of June 25, 2019, attested by Tharini Prakarshi Dias SenerathGunasekera, Notary Public of Colombo, shall be a body corporate with perpetual succession and acommon seal under the name and style of \u201cthe Trustees of the Society of Jesus in Sri Lanka\u201d ;\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 31371 \u2014 67 (10/2019)\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'29PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 29.10.20192A"
