    "chunk_text": "wxl 2147$50 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 30 jeks nodod - 2019'10'30No. 2147/50 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, OCTOBER 30, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lkG 31372 - 17 (10/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No. : 2019/16.\n\nLand Ministry Ref. No.:4-3/6/2018/HW/70.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following lands which are required for a publicpurpose.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired:\n\nAllotments of Lot No. 01 and 02 in Total Extent of about0.0098 Hectare, depicted in Preliminary Plan No. Mara 2820and dated 18.09.2019 prepared by the Senior - Superintendentof Surveyor of Matara District on behalf of the SurveyorGeneral, situated in the village of Uda Aparekka in the Grama\n\nNiladhari Divisions of No. 448, Uda Aparekka in the DivisionalSecretary\u2019s Division of Devinuwara in Matara District inSourthern Province.\n\n01. Lot No. 01Name of land: Magahena; Description: Garden; Claimant:State; Original Claimant: Prabath Senevirathna, Batadolawatta,Uda Uparekka, Uparekka (Parts of T. P. 158227 and 158228.Acquired under Section 38 (A) of Land Acquisition Act, Tofinalise the land acquisition); Extent: 0.0018 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 02Name of land: Kirigodallahena; Description: Garden,Contains a cultivation of Cinnamon about 5-6 years old;Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Late of H. K. S. C.Siriwardhana, Iskolahena, Uda Uparekka, Uparekka (Parts ofT. P. 158227 and 158228. Acquired under Section 38 (A) ofLand Acquisition Act., To finalise the land acquisition); Extent:0.0080 Hectare."
