    "chunk_size_bytes": 2074,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2147/51 - 2019 \u0d94\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dd9\u0dad\u0ddd\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc3 30 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.10.30\n\nNo. 2147/51\u2013 WEDNESDAY, OCTOBER, 30, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7 Reference No.: 3/3/6/2/30. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which are required for a public purpose. Land acquisition for building the office OIC (officer-in-charge) of Visal Matale Water Project at Ukuwela. Description of the land to be acquired: An allotment No. 01 in extent 0.1522 Hectares, of the land in Preliminary Plan No. Mu.P.Ma. 1780 prepared by the surveyor superintendent, of, Matale situated at Ukuwela village in Ukuwela Grama Niladhari Division, Matale Udasiyapathtuwe in Divisional Secretary Division of Ukuwela in the District of Matale Central Province.\n\nLot No. 01 Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: Shanthi Munasinghe Samagi Mawatha, Ukuwela; Land Extent: 0.1522 Hectare All persons interested in the aforesaid Lands on are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat of Ukuwela at 9.30 a. m. on 04.12.2019. And hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 20.11.2019 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nS. N. K. SERASINGHE, Divisional Secretary, Ukuwela.\n\n25th October, 2019, At Ukuwella Divisional Secretariat, Ukuwela.\n\n11-1035\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 31373 - 27 (2019/10)"
