    "chunk_text": "IV ^w& fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2018'06'30PART IV (A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF S RI LANKA \u2013 30.06.20181A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nw;s \u00fafYIThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (A) \u2013 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nProvincial Councils Notifications\n\nwxl 2148$7 \u2013 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 04 jeks i\u00f7od \u2013 2019'11'04No. 2148/7 \u2013 MONDAY, NOVEMBER 04, 2019\n\nCENTRAL PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nMINUTE OF THE CENTRAL PROVINCIAL PUBLIC MANAGEMENT ASSISTANTS\u2019SERVICE - AMENDMENT No. 03\n\nHon. Governor of Central Province has approved to amend the Minute of the Central Provincial Public Management Assistants\u2019Service published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1869/4 dated 30.06.2014 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka,as amended by the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2047/43 dated 30.11.2017 and No. 2107/7 and 22.01.2019 as follows.\n\n1. The title of the Service Minute referred to as the \u2018\u2018Minute of the Central Provincial public Management Assistants\u2019Service\u2019\u2019 will be substituted by the following title.\n\n\u2018\u2018Minute of the Central Provincial Management Service Officers Service\u2019\u2019\n\n2. Every term referred to as \u2018\u2018Central Provincial Public Management Assistants\u2019 Service\u2019\u2019 and every term referred to as\u2018\u2018Central Provincial Public Management Assistant\u2019\u2019 in the relevant Service Minute shall be amended as \u2018\u2018CentralProvincial Management Service Officers Service\u2019\u2019 and \u2018\u2018Central Provincial Management Service Officers\u2019\u2019 respectivelyand the term referred to as \u2018\u2018Officer\u2019\u2019 in the said Service Minute shall be reckoned as Central Provincial ManagementService Officers.\n\nM. G. A. THILAKARATNE,Secretary,Public Service Commission,Central Provincial Council.29th October, 2019Central Provincial Public Service Commission,No. 244, Katugastota Road,Kandy.11 - 1248"
