    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'05PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 05.11.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2148$19 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 05 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'11'05No. 2148/19 - TUESDAY, NOVEMBER 05, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nL.D.B 4/81(II)\n\nNATIONAL ENVIRONMENTAL ACT, NO. 47 OF 1980\n\nREGULATIONS made by the President under Paragraph (o) of Subsection (2) of Section 32 of the National EnvironmentalAct, No. 47 of 1980 read with paragraph (i) of Section 10 of that Act and Section 51 of the Nineteenth Amendment to theConstitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.\n\nMAITHRIPALA SIRISENAPresident.Colombo,04th November, 2019.Regulations\n\n1. These Regulations may be cited as the Control of Bill Boards and Hoardings (Visual Pollution) RegulationsNo. 01 of 2019\n\n2. Any bill board, hoarding, structure or device used for the purpose of displaying an advertisement shall be inconformity with these regulations and shall not be erected obstructing the view of natural environment, landscape, visualamenity and safety of persons.\n\n3. A person shall not erect any bill board, hoarding, structure or device for the purpose of displaying andadvertisement -\n\n(a)without a permit issued for such purpose by the relevant Authority specified in the Schedule hereto,subject to the payment of a fee as may be charged by such Authority ; and\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - PG 4737\u2014 2017 (11/2019)\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'05PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 05.11.20192A"
