    "chunk_size_bytes": 1881,
    "chunk_text": "This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - PG 4737\u2014 2017 (11/2019)\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'05PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 05.11.20192A\n\n4. The relevant Authority shall issue the permit for a period not more than twelve (12) months and may berenewed annually subject to the payment of a renewal fee as may be charged by such Authority.\n\n5. Where any bill board, hoarding, structure or device used for the purpose of displaying an advertisement isdisplayed for more than twelve (12) months without the permit being renewed under regulation 4, the relevant Authorityshall inform the holder of permit to remove such bill board, hoarding, structure or device used for the purpose of displayingan advertisement from such place.\n\n6. Where a bill board, hoarding, structure or device used for the purpose of displaying an advertisement is notremoved as informed by the relevant Authority under regulation 5, such Authority shall remove it and recover the cost ofsuch removal from the holder of the permit.\n\n7. The relevant authority shall have the power to remove any bill board, hoarding, structure or device used for thepurpose of displaying an advertisement -\n\n(a)to ensure safety and security of persons ;\n\n(b)to prevent the obstruction of the view of natural environment, landscape, visual amenity ; and\n\n(c)to comply with any statutory requirement.\n\n8. In these Regulations -\n\n\u201cadvertisement\u201d includes any word, letter, sign, signboard, banner, balloon and poster illuminated or non-illuminated or digitally displayed (static or moving) and posted on land, buildings, walls, hoardings,frames, kiosks, posts, tree guard, gantries, mobile vehicles, passage, shelters or temporary arches.\n\n(Regulations 3)\n\nSCHEDULE"
