ovince andbounded as follows.\n\n01. Lot A \u2013 Mahakanda Watta \u2013 Extent: About 0.0038HectaresNorth, East, South: Mahakanda Watta claimed byP.G.N.A.Pathirana; West: Road.\n\n11 - 1369"
