    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'11'08PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 08.11.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nORDER UNDER PROVISO (a) TO SECTION 38\n\nOrder No. 248 of 2019\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/6/2019/HW/37.Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: MLB/LND/LNDAQ/L1/62.\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Proviso (a) to Section 38 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Gayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms do hereby direct theAcquiring Officer or any other officer authorized by him referred toin Paragraph 1 of the Schedule to take immediate possession of theland specified in the corresponding entry in Paragraph 2 of thatSchedule.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMinistry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,No. 1200/6,Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.04th November, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Acquiring Officer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Malimbada.\n\n2. Description of the land.\u2013 The allotments of lands depicted inbelow names and extents in the Advance Tracing No. MR/MLM/RDA/2019/314 and dated 07.06.2019 prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village of Malimbada in the Minor Divisionof Gangabada Pattuwa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division ofMalimbada in Matara District in Southern Province and bounded asfollows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Galgodawatta - Extent: About 0.0790 HectareNorth: Galgodawatta claimed by P. Sugathadasa; East: Road andLot B; South: Lot Nos. 2, 7 and 5 in P.P. Mara 2715; West: Road.\n\n02. Lot \u2018B\u2019 \u2013 Extent: About 0.0026 HectareNorth: Lot A, Galgodawatta claimed by P. Sugathadasa and Road;East: Road and Lot No. 9 in P.P. Mara 2715; South: Lot Nos. 9, 8 and2 in P.P. Mara 2715; West: Lot A.\n\n11 \u2013 1424\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u