    "chunk_text": "1AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'08PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 08.11.2019\n\nwxl 2148$48 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 08 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'11'08No. 2148/48 - FRIDAY, NOVEMBER 08, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri LankaYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL Government Noti\ufb01 cations\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE NATIONAL THOROUGHFARES ACT, No. 40 OF 2008\n\nREGULATIONS made by the Minister of Highways & Road Development and Petroleum Resources Development under Section 89 (2) (c) of the Thoroughfares Act, No. 40 of 2008 read with Sections 13 and 14 of the aforesaid Act.\n\nKABIR HASHIM, Minister of Highways & Road Development and Petroleum Resources Development. Battaramulla,08th November, 2019. REGULATIONS (1) These Regulations may be cited as the National Thoroughfares (User Fee National Highway) Regulations (2) These regulations shall apply to -\n\nThe Barawakumbuka \u2013 Mattala User fee National Highway (Section of Extension of Southern Expressway) and Andarawewa \u2013 Hambantota User Fee National Highway declared by Order made under Section 11 of the National Thoroughfares Act, No. 40 of 2008 published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. Gazette No. to be inserted once this has been declared as a National Highway)\n\n(3) (1) There shall be levied from a driver of every vehicle being used on the aforesaid User Fee National Highways, a fee in respect of the use of the User Fee National Highway by such driver, at such rates speci\ufb01 ed in Part A of the Schedule to these regulations.\n\n1A\u2014G 31111 - 57 (11/2019)\n\n2AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc 