    "chunk_size_bytes": 2014,
    "chunk_text": "The word \u201chad\u201d in the fourth line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with \u201chave\u201d.\n\nThe rectifications introduced to the upper part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be read as follows;\n\n\u201cNOTICE OF APPROVAL OF THE DEVELOPMENT PLAN FOR THE POLONNARUWA URBAN DEVELOPMENT AREACOMPRISING OF THE POLONNARUWA MUNICIPAL COUNCIL AND POLONNARUWA PRADESHIYA SABHA (PART)AREAS\u201d\n\n\u201cNOTICE is hereby given to the General Public of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka under Section 8G of theUrban Development Authority Law, No. 41 of 1978 as amended from time to time that I, Patali Champika Ranawaka, theMinister in charge of the subject of Megapolis & Western Development, by virtue of the powers vested in me under Section8F of the said Law, have approved the Development Plan on the 28th day of June, 2019 for the Polonnaruwa UrbanDevelopment area comprising of the Polonnaruwa Municipal Council and Polonnaruwa Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) areas,preparted under Section 8A of the said Law.\u201d\n\nPATALI CHAMPIKA RANAWAKA,Minister of Megapolis and Western Development.\n\n07th November, 2019.\n\nIn the caption of the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification the words \u201cMunicipal Council Areas\u201d shallbe Subsitituted with \u201cUrban Development Area comprising of the Polonnaruwa Municipal Council and PolonnaruwaPradeshiya Sabha (Part) Areas\u201d.\n\nThe content of the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be rectified by establishing therelevance of the said Development Plan to, Polonnaruwa Urban Development Area comprising of the Polonnriwa MunicipalCouncil and Polonnaruwa Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) Areas.\n\nThe word \u201cAmendment\u201d in the second line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with\u201cLow, No. 41 of 1978 as amended by the\u201d.\n\nThe words \u201cAmendment Act\u201d given in the last line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with\u201camended Law.\u201d"
