    "chunk_size_bytes": 1948,
    "chunk_text": "The word \u201chad\u201d in the fourth line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with \u201chave\u201d.\n\nThe rectifications introduced to the upper part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be read as follows;\n\n\u201cNOTICE OF APPROVAL OF THE DEVELOPMENT PLAN FOR THE ANURADHAPURA URBAN DEVELOPMENT AREACOMPRISING OF ANURADHAPURA MUNICIPAL COUNCIL, NUWARAGAMA PALATHA CENTRAL PRADESHIYASABHA (PART) AND NUWARAGAMA PALATHA EAST PRADESHIYA SABHA (PART) AREAS.\u201d\n\n\u201cNOTICE is hereby given to the General Public of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka under Section 8G of theUrban Development Authority Law, No. 41 of 1978 as amended from time to time that I, Patali Champika Ranawaka, theMinister in charge of the subject of Megapolis & Western Development, by virtue of the powers vested in me under Section8F of the said Law, have approved the Development Plan on the 28th day of June, 2019 for the Anuradhapura UrbanDevelopment Area comprising of Anuradhapura Municipal Council, Nuwaragam Palatha Central Pradeshiya Shaba(Part) and Nuwaragam Palatha East Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) areas prepared under Section 8A of the said Law.\u201d\n\nPATALI CHAMPIKA RANAWAKA,Minister of Megapolis and Western Development.\n\n07th November, 2019.\n\nIn the caption of the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification the words \u201cMunicipal Council Areas\u201d shallbe Subsitituted with \u201cUrban Development Area comprising of Aunradhapura Municipal Council, Nuwaragam PalathaCentral Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) and Nuwaragama Palatha East Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) Areas.\u201d\n\nThe content of the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be rectified by establishing therelevance of the said Development Plan to, Anuradhapura Urban Development Area comprising of Anuradhapura MuncipalCouncil, Nuwaragam Palatha Central Pradehiya Sabha (Part) and Nuwaragama Palatha East Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) Areas."
