    "chunk_text": "1AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'08PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 08.11.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2148$54 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 08 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'11'08\n\nNo. 2148/54 - FRIDAY, NOVEMBER 08, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A- G 31436 - 19 (11/2019)\n\nTHE NOTICE TO RECTIFY THE EXTRAORDINARY GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST\n\nREPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA BEARING No. 2129/95 DATED 28TH JUNE, 2019\n\nI, Patali Champika Ranawaka, Minister of Megapolis and Western Development, by virtue of the powers vested in me underthe Urban Development Authority Law, No. 41 of 1978 as amended, do hereby rectify the Extraordinary Gazette Notificationbearing No. 2129/95 dated 28th June, 2019 (07-4554/8).\n\nIn the caption of the upper part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification the word \u201c(PART)\u201d Shall be includedimmediately after \u201cEMBILIPITIYA PRADESHIYA SABHA\u201d and the word \u201cAUTHORITY\u201d (given in the second line)shall be deleted.\n\nThe content of the upper part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be rectified by inserting the word \u201c(Part)\u201dimmediately after \u201cEmbilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha\u201d given in the fifth line thereof.\n\nThe word \u201chad\u201d in the fourth line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with \u201chave\u201d.\n\nThe rectifications introduced to the upper part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be read as follows;\n\n\u201cNOTICE OF APPROVAL OF THE DEVELOPMENT PLAN FOR THE EMBILIPITIYA URBAN DEVELOPMENT AREACOMPRISING OF EMBILIPITIYA URBAN COUNCIL AND EMBILIPITIYA PRADESHIYA SABHA (PART) AREAS.\u201d"
  },
