    "md5": "72e6f72ee1b2016c46d0dacc5f1c7cce",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2006,
    "chunk_text": "In the content of the upper of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification, the word \u201chad\u201d in the fourth line shall besubstituted with \u201chave\u201d.\n\nThe rectifications introduced to the upper part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be read as follows:\n\n\u201cNOTICE OF APPROVAL OF THE DEVELOPMENT PLAN FOR THE MAHO URBAN DEVELOPMENT AREACOMPRISING OF THE MAHO PRADESHIYA SABHA (PART) AREAS.\u201d\n\n\u201cNOTICE is hereby given to the General Public of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka under Section 8G of theUrban Development Authority Law, No. 41 of 1978 as amended from time to time that I, Patali Champika Ranawaka, theMinister in charge of the subject of Megapolis and Western Development, by virtue of the powers vested in me underSection 8F of the said Law, have approved the Development Plan on the 28th day of June, 2019 for the Maho UrbanDevelopment Area comprising of the Maho Pradeshiya Sabha (Part) area, prepared under Section 8A of the saidLaw.\u201d\n\nPATALI CHAMPIKA RANAWAKA,Minister of Megapolis and Western Development.\n\n07th November, 2019.\n\nThe caption of the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be rectified by inserting \u201cthe MahoUrban Development Area Comprising of\u201d immediately after \u201cfor\u201d and by inserting the word \u201c(Part)\u201d immediately after\u201cMaho Pradeshiya Sabha\u201d.\n\nThe content of the latter part of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be rectified by inserting \u201ctheMaho Urban Development Area comprising of\u201d Immediately after \u201cfor\u201d given in the second line thereof and byinserting the word \u201c(Part)\u201d immediately after \u201cMaho Pradeshiya Sabha\u201d given in the second line thereof.\n\nThe word \u201c(Amendment)\u201d in the second line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substitutedwith \u201cLaw, No. 41 of 1978 as amended by the\u201d.\n\nThe word \u201cAmendment Act\u201d given in the last line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with\u201cAmended Law.\u201d"
