    "chunk_text": "The word \u201c(Amendment)\u201d in the second line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substitutedwith \u201cLaw, No. 41 of 1978 as amended by the\u201d.\n\nThe word \u201cAmendment Act\u201d given in the last line of the said Extraordinary Gazette Notification shall be substituted with\u201cAmended Law.\u201d\n\n\u201cApproval of the Development Plan for the Maho Urban Development Area comprising of Maho Pradeshiya Sabha(Part) Area\u201d.\n\n\u201cPublic are hereby informed that the Development Plan prepared under Section 8A of the Urban Development AuthorityLaw, No. 41 of 1978 as amended by the Act, No. 4 of 1982, for the Maho Urban Development Area comprising of the MahoPradeshiya Sabha (Part) areas has been approved on 28th June, 2019, by Hon. Patali Champika Ranawaka, Minister ofMegapolis and Western Development, by virtue of the powers vested in him under Section 8F of the said amended Law.\u201d\n\nDR. JAGATH MUNASINGHE,Chairman,Urban Development Authority.07th November, 2019.\n\nNotwithstanding the provisions contained in the antecedent Gazette Notification bearing No. 2129/96 dated 28th June,2019 (07-4555/12), the rectification hereinbefore mentioned shall have retrospective effect and shall be deemed to havecome into operation on the 28th day of June, 2019.\n\nPATALI CHAMPIKA RANAWAKA,Minister of Megapolis and Western Development.\n\n07th November, 2019.\n\n11 - 1489\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
