    "chunk_text": "Mr. P. K. Ajantha, No. 118 N/19, Egodakanatta, Bope, Galle.\n\nand\n\nSouthern Provincial Road Development Authority, No. 19, Lower Dickson Road, Galle.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is .\u2013\n\nDated at the office of the Commissioner General of Labour.Colombo,A. WIMALAWEERA,Commissioner General of Labour.\n\n28th October, 2019.\n\n11 - 1510/2\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/04/2018/194.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4 (1)\n\nWHEREAS AN industrial dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner of Labour which accompanies thisorder exists between,\n\n01. Mr. R. Menikgama Arachchi, No. 410/17, Kelanimulla, Mulleriyawa New Town.02. Mr. M. K. D. Manoj Gunaruwan, No. 21/7, Siddamulla, Piliyandala of the one part\n\nand\n\nNational Water Supply and Drainage Board, Galle Road, Rathmalana of the other part\n\nNOW THEREFORE I, Ravindra Samaraweera, Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations do by virtue of the powers vested in me bySection 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 Revised Edition), as amended byAct, Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes - Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint\n\nMrs. K. A. Piyarathne, 224/ 14A, Malwatta Road, Kahantota, Malabe to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him forsettlement by arbitration.\n\nRAVINDRA SAMARAWEERA,Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations.\n\nColombo,04th November, 2019.\n\n6AI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'11'09PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 09.11.2019\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/04/2018/194.\n\nT