    "chunk_text": "wxl 2149$9 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 11 jeks i`\u00ffod - 2019'11'11No. 2149/9 \u2013 MONDAY, NOVEMBER 11, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nL.D.B 5/2005\n\nMEDIATION (SPECIAL CATEGORIES OF DISPUTES) ACT, NO. 21 OF 2003\n\nREGULATIONS made by the Minister of Justice and Prison Reforms under Section 27 read with section 4 of the Mediation(Special Categories of Disputes) Act, No. 21 of 2003.\n\nTHALATHA ATUKORALEMinister of Justice and Prison Reforms.\n\nColombo.29th October, 2019.\n\nRegulations\n\n1.These regulations may be cited as the Special Mediation (Qualifications of Mediators) Regulations No. 1 of2019.\n\n2.A person eligible to be appointed as a Member of a Panel of Mediators, in the Special Mediation Board area specifiedin the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2125/8 of May 27, 2019 relating to a dispute of the category ofdisputes determined by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2078/36 dated July 04, 2018, shall :-\n\n(a)be between 35 to 70 years of age;\n\n(b)be a resident of the Special Mediation Board area;\n\n(c)have a professional or academic qualification obtained from a recognized professional orhigher education body established by or under any written law; and\n\n(d)have been or be a public officer, or a person who holds knowledge and skills in an arearelevant to settlements of disputes and grievances of migrant workers.\n\n11-1542\n\nPG 4745 - 507 (2019/11)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
