    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'13PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 13.11.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2149$17 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 13 jeks nodod - 2019'11'13No. 2149/17 - WEDNESDAY NOVEMBER 13, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nProclamations & C., by the President\n\nPROCLAMATION BY THE PRESIDENT\n\nMAITHRIPALA SIRISENA\n\nWHEREAS the premises of the Shrine of Our Lady of Madhu situated in the Divisional Secretary's Division in the Districtof Mannar in the Northern Province of Sri Lanka is highly venerated by Catholic devotees in Sri Lanka and the world over,And whereas the Shrine of our Lady Madhu has been proclaimed an Urban Development area by Gazette NotificationNo. 2145/55 dated 19.10.2019 under Section 6(2)(b) and 21(2)(b) of the Town and Country Planning Ordinance No. 13 of1946 aimed at providing the full range of facilities required to ensure the convenience of the devotees visiting to payhomage at the Shirne of Our Lady of Madhu.\n\nAnd whereas Madhu pilgrimage regulations have been promulgated by Gazette Notification No. 185 dated 19thMarch 1982 under Pilgrimages Ordinance No. 13 of 1896 with the view of providing the opportunity for the hundreds ofthousand of people visiting the Madhu Pilgrims' area during the said Madhu Pilgrims' season to stay in without their havingto undergo difficulties."
