    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'14PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 14.11.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2149$20 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 14 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'11'14No. 2149/20 - THURSDAY, NOVEMBER 14, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nL.D.B. 3/2012(XIII)\n\nTOURISM ACT, No. 38 OF 2005\n\nREGULATIONS made by the Minister of Tourism Development, Wild Life and Christian Religious Affairs on the adviceof the Sri Lanka Tourism Development Authority under Section 69 of the Tourism Act, No. 38 of 2005 read with subsections(3), (6) and (7) of Section 48 and Subsection (1) of Section 50 of the aforesaid Act.\n\nJOHN ANTHONY EMMANUAL AMARATUNGA,Minister of Tourism Development, Wild Life andChristian Religious Affairs.\n\nColombo,\n\nRegulations\n\n1. These regulations may be cited as the Tourism (Registration of Ayurvedic Hotel) Regulations No. 2 of 2019.\n\n2. No person shall carry on business of a Ayurvedic Hotel as a Tourist Enterprise unless such enterprise isregistered with the Sri Lanka Tourism Development Authority (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cAuthority\u201d) and obtained alicense for such enterprise from the Authority.\n\n3. The provisions of the Tourism (Classification of Tourist Hotels) Regulation No. 1 of 2016 published in theGazette Extraordinary No. 1963/28 dated April 20, 2016 shall apply in relation to Ayurvedic Hotels.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 31457\u2014 27 (11/2019)\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'14PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 14.11.20192A\n\nPART I\n\nRegistration of Ayurvedic Hotels"
  },
