    "chunk_text": "wxl 2150$3 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 18 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'11'18\n\nNo. 2150/3 \u2013 MONDAY, NOVEMBER 18, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nG 31470 - 17 (2019/11) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nAS AMENDED BY THE LAND ACQUISITION\n\n(AMENDMENT) ACT NO. 28 OF 1964\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nReference No.: DIVKE /LND /LND2 /ACQUT/5/7.\n\n: 4-3/8/2016/PC/509.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act No.28 of 1964, that theGovernment intends to acquire the following Land/Servitudewhich is required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:\n\nThe allotment of land referred in the sheet No. 5 of additionalNo.5 of F.V.P. 2563, in Hodiwewa village in 1128 MadalpolaGrama Niladhari Division in Kuliyapitiya - East DivisionalSecretary Division in Kurunegala District of North WesternProvince.\n\n1. Lot No. 88Name of the Land: Attikkagahamula, Katakalagahamulawaththa, Kongahamulawaththa; Description of Land:Waththa, A permanent building and a well, constructed using\n\ncement; Claimed by: Punchibanda H.M. and Hereth H.M.S.K,reside at Alahitiyawa, Hodiwewa; Extent: 0.0149 hec.\n\nNorth by: Lots No. 37 and 36; East by: Lot 36; South by:Lots No.36 and 37; West by: Lot 37.\n\nAll persons interested, in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, beforeme at Kuliyapitiya -East Divisional Secretariat, on the day ofthe 22nd January 2020 at 10.30 a.m."
